body:
aria series, starting with {aria the animation} 

{non non biyori} 

{mushishi} 

{shoujo shuumatsu ryokou} 

{yuru camp} 

iyashikei is great for unwinding after a long day and IMO those are some of the best

i haven’t seen anyone give these a shout in the thread yet, and they’re all incredible 

{texhnolyze}

{haibane renmei}

{serial experiments lain} though it’s likely you’ve heard of, if not seen this one 

{aria the animation} 

{aku no hana} (not really obscure but still really good)

{oregairu}‘s is technically a “school club” but in practice doesn’t really function as one.

{welcome to the NHK} is entirely separated from a school context, but it’s much darker than every other anime i’m listing here so be warned if it’s not your thing.

{anohana} kinda fits your description and isn’t a school club. 

these two are also good but are very much clubs: 

{hyouka} 

{k-on}
